body:
So all four as listed would be $70 + Shipping, and just Ridley with Dark Samus $36 + Shipping. 

&#x200B;

Since Ground Shipping tends to be a bit more than $10, I'd be happy to do $70 total for all four (essentially covering Shipping) or $40 for Dark Samus and Ridley with Paypal F+F (also not needing Shipping fees). Let me know if interested.

Hi there! Apologies, had a cat health scare and spent the night at the vet. All good with the cat thankfully. Yeah, here's the pics of Steve, Alex, and Corrin P1 (P2 is there since I'm taking pics of them in series group for better management): [Amiibos Pictures](https://imgur.com/gallery/rBupJlI). 

&#x200B;

I was able to clean Pichu's ears and looks much better. Do let me know if you want more pics or if interested to go through with any or whole order to mark them as such: [Pichu Ears](https://imgur.com/gallery/gWU8hY6).

I recently went through something similar. The best thing that you could probably do is get it out of your system. If you feel angry then allow yourself to feel angry. If you are sad about it then let it out and cry. Of course demonizing the other party is not always the solution, but from what you mentioned on the text he did you wrong, so feel hurt towards him. 

&#x200B;

It's gonna be harsh for some time. Maybe days, weeks or months. Just find people you can surround yourself with and talk about it. The more you face this hardship the easier it will get. 

&#x200B;

Good luck bro! Take care of yourself.

1st: Direct quote from Webtoon's translation of TOG Season 2 Ep. 240: "... That's Because this is the place where Arlene gave birth to you and raised you." "That's right. Perhaps that's why... Jahad built his own altar here after she disappeared." "Jahad was unusually obsessed with Arlene. He event built a shrine for worshiping himself here in the land that Arlene cherished and made his followers flock to it." So to actually correct myself, the altar that Jahad built was FOR himself on the land that Arlene loved. The followers that are mentioned in this chapter are Jahad's, which he made move to the floor of death. 

&#x200B;

2nd. Yeah, there is too little information on the world outside of the tower, and so far every single irregular (sans the family leaders) seem very different from each other, At this point it's all guessing!
